      "strategy": "incremental_by_identity via the governed_merge custom materialization: unique_key trade_number; frozen_columns (owning_account_number, placed_at, owning_account_effective_from, owning_customer_number, owning_customer_effective_from, first_seen_late) computed from each trade's first report and written only on insert; mutable_columns (status, executed_price, fees, commission, tax, quantity) computed from the latest I- or U-flagged raw.trade_cdc report and refreshed on match. placed_at (and the status used for first_seen_late) prefer the trade's earliest raw.trade_history row where one exists, else the earliest raw.trade_cdc row by report_order; owning_account_number is always the earliest raw.trade_cdc row's t_ca_id (raw.trade_history carries no account). owning_account_effective_from/owning_customer_number resolved via as_of_event_time against governed.account at placed_at; owning_customer_effective_from resolved via as_of_event_time against governed.customer, for the customer named by that pinned account statement, at placed_at.",
